      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JACKPOT CHEVY (2) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts three wins and two placings. Hit the frame latest (23.23) when second at The Gardens in a Grade 5. Rates on top and should go close. RHONDA FULL DAY (3) drew this same box last time when in the minors (23.34) in a Grade 5 over 400m at The Gardens. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. TIGRESS WINK (7) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (17.55) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Deserves serious consideration again. MAJESTIC SOCKS (8) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
